./docs/stability_report.md:17:These are paired seat orientations, not 768 independent worlds. Cash is supporting evidence; the competition rewards match outcomes.
./docs/stability_report.md:29:The win-rate differences versus v3 are uncertain at this sample size: both paired 95% intervals span zero. However, twelve-turn cash margins regressed across this panel, and its worst-decile mean and worst individual margin were worse than v3. This does not prove a universal ordering; it does rule out describing the direct-matchup improvement alone as broad stability evidence.
